- `linux-unit` ctest: passed on a rerun. The first run had one failure in `platform_x11_input_tests.cpp`: an XTest pointer-motion check saw 6360 px instead of 3. That is a live-desktop race and unrelated to this change, and it passed on the next run.
- `linux-gcc` configure, build, and `linux-gcc-unit`: pass.
